{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackflow</strong> is a hypnotically addictive <strong>strategic roguelike</strong> about the pure pleasure of fitting pieces perfectly. Discover <strong>unique blocks</strong>, create satisfying connections, and trigger explosive combos that release pure dopamine. Overcome escalating challenges in each level by hitting target scores through clever strategies and perfect timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/b0ced0ee7767ca27affd57e604f9e142.poster.avif?t=1762556351\" aria-label=\"Fitting pieces of the game together to get points and multipliers.\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/b0ced0ee7767ca27affd57e604f9e142.webm?t=1762556351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/b0ced0ee7767ca27affd57e604f9e142.mp4?t=1762556351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIAL GAME-BREAKING BLOCKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique blocks with devastating powers! Indestructible <strong>Obsidian</strong> with permanent multipliers, <strong>Stone</strong> that explodes into points, and much more. Every choice redefines your strategy and opens infinite possibilities for insane combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/66b1463782a4d935ba44781ab5987eac.poster.avif?t=1762556351\" aria-label=\"Three buttons where you may choose a new block to bring new abilities to your gameplay\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/66b1463782a4d935ba44781ab5987eac.webm?t=1762556351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/66b1463782a4d935ba44781ab5987eac.mp4?t=1762556351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME-CHANGING ADVANTAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Powerful advantages that completely revolutionize your playstyle! Smart automation, explosive multipliers, and unique mechanics that make every run unpredictable and addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/2a26c42be0d381349a7289a8c0ce4bf1.poster.avif?t=1762556351\" aria-label=\"Three buttons where you may choose a new upgrade for your gameplay.\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/2a26c42be0d381349a7289a8c0ce4bf1.webm?t=1762556351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/extras/2a26c42be0d381349a7289a8c0ce4bf1.mp4?t=1762556351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting the Hang of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/5a15857e1141d4556bcbd3f2c902b4c21a1795c4.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/d3b17b0c1c6a52766e3a5bdd2105a05d40e514c3.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner's Luck (Or Skill?)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/fab3a22ca64ab0dee2d00d5120eac7bfbc18ff08.jpg"},{"name":"Block Placer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/0e34ed32d59e0fed9cb670dcb51e1fa267433b29.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Stacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/b8e5a8591269fb58dd33dce9e680380a8d97b95c.jpg"},{"name":"Block Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/a0191d79d4fafe5c470c388d2411d2d0dfcfe9d8.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Maestro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/940de744ec4fe73542fc0c25be12ffa37c5aea76.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/5a55db85b45bfb861050a89eec2b1a8258b0cc96.jpg"},{"name":"The Moai","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/e80aaf55cf387401702a18ac7f4c11cfe4c18ff5.jpg"},{"name":"The X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3908810/bff5c6662c2a708daf53655ab1ccb731d2566bc1.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908810?t=1762556351","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908810?t=1762556351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/cdb9f2bd8149c8ffba8eb22cd4c4de67885c6e11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762556351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908810/cdb9f2bd8149c8ffba8eb22cd4c4de67885c6e11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762556351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3925910,"description":""}],